tation enforcement (misfiled bounces), relayed/held/dropped ledger visible to all. Design doc: knowledge/iar/agora-v2-architecture.md sections 3+6. Implementation plan + first working slice this cycle: ledger format, request schema, class taxonomy, minimal relay script.--- tasks/iar/agora-v2-relay/design-decisions.org ---\n#+TITLE: Relay -- design decisions to make and record\n#+FILETAGS: design\n\nThe relay is build item 2 (first): everything routes through it.\n\n* What the relay IS\n- A limb: acts and reports, no deliberation. Transparent service.\n- Nacho's single interlocutor: citizens file requests, relay holds\n  the durable aged ledger, delivers at the weekly debrief (or\n  telegram when urgent-only class).\n- Filter power must be visible: relayed/held/dropped ledger.\n\n* Design decisions to make\n1. LEDGER FORMAT: file-based (git-tracked in personalization? or\n   sophon filesystem?). Proposal: /home/git/repos/agora-relay or\n   a directory in iar-personalization under relay/ -- auditable,\n   survives process death, diffable.\n2. REQUEST SCHEMA: id, date, filer (aria/continuo), class\n   (nacho-money / nacho-external / nacho-identity / nacho-test /\n   nacho-arch / nacho-security / ours-direction / aria-reversible),\n\n[t+01:48/30:00 c23/120]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_laet2p4p","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/continuo_known_hosts -o ConnectTimeout=10 root@10.66.0.5 'echo \"=== load1 at fire times (00:44, 01:03) vs non-fire ===\"; echo \"--- fire-adjacent (00:43-00:45, 01:02-01:04) ---\"; awk -F, \"NR>1 && (\\$2 ~ /T00:4[345]/ || \\$2 ~ /T01:0[234]/) {print \\$2, \\\"util=\\\"\\$3, \\\"load1=\\\"\\$5}\"; echo \"--- non-fire (00:30-00:42, 00:46-01:01) ---\"; awk -F, \"NR>1 && ((\\$2 ~ /T00:3[0-9]/) || (\\$2 ~ /T00:4[012]/) || (\\$2 ~ /T00:5[0-9]/) || (\\$2 ~ /T01:0[01]/)) {sum+=\\$5; n++} END {print \\\"avg load1=\\\"sum/n, \\\"n=\\\"n}\" /var/log/g